                {/* 🎛️ EMBEDDED BROADCAST CONTROL OVERLAY AT TOP OF VIDEO FRAME (Captura z.png / image.png) */}
                {/* 🎛️ TOP HOVER ZONE & EMBEDDED BROADCAST CONTROL OVERLAY (Captura z.png) */}
